<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n15022" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρί-γνωτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <i><span class="en">
			Od.
			6.108
		</span></i>, 
			Aeol.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			Sapph.
			<u>Supp.</u>
			25.4
		</span></i>, also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ος</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			Il.
			15.490
		</span></i>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>easy to be
				known,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρίγνωτοι δὲ θεοί περ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					13.72
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				15.490
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Sapph.
			</span></i> l.c.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δώματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					6.300
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥεῖά τ᾽ ἀριγνώτη
			πέλεται</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				108
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> ill bad
			sense, <i>infamous,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὦ ἀρίγνωτε συβῶτα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					17.375
				</span></i>
			.</div>
